# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): Wander and Chord on the Tunings (Evan, 2026-10-30). Drone I on D3,
# drone II on A3, Wander (par78) fast on its minor pentatonic (par81 0), Pitch glide (par50) a little: on LMY (par110
# 7, the 12-note keys: LMY's own intervals), then 31-tone (3, the nearest to the pure ones); then Chord (A4, w9) on
# Just (5, pure over drone I) and on Partch (10). The Setup 2 page on LMY. Not a test of its own (no expectations).
notips
set 74 0
set 51 0
set 0 5000
set 21 5700
set 50 25
set 81 0
pressure w9 0
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap GLO
tap GLO
set 110 7
spin K4 1
spin K4 -1
wait 300
shot tunings-setup.png
tap HOME
wav tunings.wav
set 78 85
wait 8000
set 110 3
wait 8000
set 78 0
wait 2000
set 110 5
key w9 down
pressure w9 127
wait 6000
pressure w9 0
key w9 up
wait 4000
set 110 10
key w9 down
pressure w9 127
wait 6000
pressure w9 0
key w9 up
wait 4000
wavstop
